WEBVTT

00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:06.041
- [Snappy] Wow.
- [gasps]

00:00:06.042 --> 00:00:07.541
- It's so pretty.
- It's so clean!

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:08.832
[Smarty Pants] When did she become neat?

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.124
[Atlas] I can see the floor.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:11.791
[Snappy] I can see me in the floor.

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:13.666
It smells like vanilla.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:14.791
With hints of brown sugar.

00:00:14.792 --> 00:00:16.416
[Smarty Pants] You know who I don't miss?

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:17.624
[Snappy] That stupid stuffed whale.

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:19.582
- [Atlas] <i>What was his name?</i>
- [Smarty Pants] <i>Spouty.</i>

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:20.916
[Snappy] <i>The worst.</i>

00:00:20.917 --> 00:00:22.207
[Smarty Pants] <i>Give me a break.</i>

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:23.291
[Snappy] <i>Annoying.</i>

00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:26.332
Seriously, how much have we missed?

00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:27.458
Everything.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:30.582
Your Blaze ain't the kid
you remember anymore.

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:31.874
How would you know?

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:35.166
[sighs] I've seen all this before.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.874
Spent a lot of years under the bed

00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:39.708
watching my first kid grow up without me.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.332
- Hey, that's our address.
- [GPS beeping]

00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:45.541
How old is Blaze anyway? Nine, ten?

00:00:45.542 --> 00:00:47.041
Her room looks like a teenager's.

00:00:47.042 --> 00:00:48.916
She's nine and a half,
thank you very much.

00:00:48.917 --> 00:00:51.791
It's 'cause you devices
make 'em change so fast.

00:00:51.792 --> 00:00:53.541
[groans] I gotta get back.

00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:55.583
- So, where--
- [whinnies]

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:58.500
Bullseye! Thank goodness.

00:00:59.583 --> 00:01:01.999
Uh-huh, they seem nice, Bullseye,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.291
but we have to go now.

00:01:03.292 --> 00:01:04.916
Wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:07.291
So you're saying that
this was your room too?

00:01:07.292 --> 00:01:08.999
- Yes.
- [scoffs] Really?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.082
- [chuckling]
- What, you calling me a liar?

00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.167
No...

00:01:13.208 --> 00:01:14.791
Yeah. Yeah, liar.

00:01:14.792 --> 00:01:16.291
[sighs]

00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:17.375
[♪ tense music playing]

00:01:17.917 --> 00:01:19.499
There's a knot in the ceiling,

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.291
looks like an angry eye
when you squint at it.

00:01:21.292 --> 00:01:22.916
Window's got a small crack

00:01:22.917 --> 00:01:24.624
like a spider in
the upper right-hand corner.

00:01:24.625 --> 00:01:26.957
And out on that tire swing hill,

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:29.624
Emily and I would play
every summer afternoon.

00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:31.416
Now, Bullseye, let's go.

00:01:31.417 --> 00:01:33.374
Uh, you're welcome.

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:36.541
For what? You didn't help me
at all. You were--

00:01:36.542 --> 00:01:38.958
What? Go on. Say it.

00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:42.999
- Useless.
- [gasps]

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.582
- Oh, no, she didn't.
- Oh, snap!

00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:46.416
- [Jimmy Dean snorting]
- [gasps]

00:01:46.417 --> 00:01:48.458
Oh, no. Not the pig!

00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.333
[♪ "I Love It" playing through headphones]

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:55.666
- [Blaze humming]
- [snorting]

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:56.917
Jimmy got big.

00:01:58.292 --> 00:01:59.958
Lay it on me, Jimmy Dean!

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:04.374
Who's coming? Sally's coming.
Who's coming? Sally's coming.

00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:07.416
Yeah, yeah. She's coming.
She's coming to my house.

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:09.082
hi! are you on your way?

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:11.332
Hey, Mom! Sally's texting me right now.

00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:12.749
She's probably on her way.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:13.832
uhhh

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.166
oops

00:02:15.167 --> 00:02:16.999
I forgot! lol

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.083
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:23.750
[sighs]

00:02:30.792 --> 00:02:32.792
[sobbing]

00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:38.417
[snorting]

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.625
You'll be my friend, right, Jimmy?

00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:54.958
Always.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:03:00.666
By the way, your hair looks so good today.

00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:02.041
[chuckles]

00:03:02.042 --> 00:03:03.333
Thank you, Jimmy.

00:03:06.583 --> 00:03:09.041
She's perfect!

00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:10.124
[blusters]

00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:12.541
We gotta get Blaze to meet Bonnie.

00:03:12.542 --> 00:03:13.957
[chuckles]

00:03:13.958 --> 00:03:15.499
[snoring]

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.582
- Bonnie.
- [gasps]

00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:17.707
Tag, you're it!

00:03:17.708 --> 00:03:18.791
We're home.

00:03:18.792 --> 00:03:20.957
Hi, hon. How was the sleepover?

00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:22.249
I don't wanna talk about it.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.416
- Why? What happened?
- Nothing.

00:03:24.417 --> 00:03:25.666
That doesn't sound good.

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:27.166
I don't see Jessie.

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:28.291
Calm down, lover boy.

00:03:28.292 --> 00:03:29.499
Your fiancée's coming.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:30.832
Fiancée?

00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:33.207
Buzz Lightyear, you never told me.

00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:36.416
I know. Isn't it exciting?
Well, it's not official yet.

00:03:36.417 --> 00:03:38.166
I have to, you know, ask her.

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:40.249
Uh, FYI, I am ordained.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.041
- Since when?
- Last Halloween.

00:03:42.042 --> 00:03:43.832
Bonnie made me a haunted priest, remember?

00:03:43.833 --> 00:03:45.166
- [toys] Oh, yeah.
- Guys, places.

00:03:45.167 --> 00:03:46.250
Bonnie's coming.

00:03:48.542 --> 00:03:49.916
[Bonnie's mom] Did you make some friends?

00:03:49.917 --> 00:03:50.999
I guess so.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.582
Aw, she looks awful.

00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:53.833
Does anyone see Jessie?

00:03:54.917 --> 00:03:56.416
[Woody] So, that's Lilypad?

00:03:56.417 --> 00:03:58.207
[Bonnie's mom]
How about I make you a snack?

00:03:58.208 --> 00:04:00.582
[Bonnie] Yes, please. I'm starving.

00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:03.374
Jessie. [grunts] Jessie. Bullseye.

00:04:03.375 --> 00:04:04.749
- Where are you?
- Oh, no, oh, no.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.041
Is this not the right version?

00:04:06.042 --> 00:04:08.249
What? Where's Jessie? Where's Bullseye?

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:10.416
I'm a little busy
helping Bonnie right now.

00:04:10.417 --> 00:04:12.291
What on earth happened at that sleepover?

00:04:12.292 --> 00:04:13.457
Excuse me. What are you?

00:04:13.458 --> 00:04:14.999
Are you like some sort of old man toy?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.082
What?

00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:18.082
She thinks you're old
because you're bald, Woody.

00:04:18.083 --> 00:04:19.874
- Why, you little--
- Where's Jessie?

00:04:19.875 --> 00:04:22.041
What happened to Bonnie?
She looks miserable.

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:23.749
Uh, the girls may have played
hide-and-seek

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.707
and, um, forgotten to find Bonnie.

00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:27.082
- [all gasp]
- Poor Bonnie.

00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:28.166
How could you let that happen?

00:04:28.167 --> 00:04:30.582
I didn't. You toys did this!

00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:33.332
These girls have been
on The Pond for over a year,

00:04:33.333 --> 00:04:34.416
but Bonnie is behind

00:04:34.417 --> 00:04:37.124
because all of the time
she's been playing with you!

00:04:37.125 --> 00:04:38.749
I need to bring her up to speed fast,

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:39.832
starting with Turtle Tag.

00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:41.749
It's the quickest way for her
to connect with the girls.

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:43.832
I'm only gonna ask one more time, frog.

00:04:43.833 --> 00:04:45.082
Where is Jessie?

00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:46.499
Not my problem. I'm very busy.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:47.874
- [all gasp]
- That's it.

00:04:47.875 --> 00:04:49.291
- We'll make her talk.
- I'll do it, Woody.

00:04:49.292 --> 00:04:50.374
- [grunts]
- Hey! Hey!

00:04:50.375 --> 00:04:51.749
- I got it. I'll--
- I got it, Buzz. No.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.541
- [Lilypad] Back off, buddy.
- I got this. Ow!

00:04:53.542 --> 00:04:55.124
Do not touch me. Don't touch--

00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:56.500
Where's Jessie?

00:04:57.333 --> 00:04:59.832
Okay. You toys are out of here.

00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:01.332
[♪ ominous music playing]

00:05:01.333 --> 00:05:02.625
[gasps] Wait. She's doing something.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.291
- So long, toys.
- [alarm blaring]

00:05:05.292 --> 00:05:06.207
hey dad

00:05:06.208 --> 00:05:07.124
[shouts]

00:05:07.125 --> 00:05:09.166
- Turn her off!
- Turn her off!

00:05:09.167 --> 00:05:10.666
I can't! I can't! It's not responding!

00:05:10.667 --> 00:05:11.749
I have plastic fingers!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:12.833
She's coming.

00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:14.749
[alarm stops]

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:15.958
Can you put my toys in the garage?

00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:18.292
hey dad
Can you put my toys in the garage?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.957
You sure you want me to take these toys?

00:05:20.958 --> 00:05:22.166
Mm-hmm.

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:24.083
Okay. It's your room.

00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.500
[gasps]

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.000
No!

00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:30.124
They'll be in the garage if you want them.

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:31.208
Yep.

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:37.583
[Mr. Pricklepants] I now
pronounce us in storage.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.125
[chuckles] <i>Playing with you is fun.</i>

00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:46.625
Okay. Now what do we d--

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:49.583
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:05:50.375 --> 00:05:51.583
[sighs]

00:05:54.417 --> 00:05:57.125
Don't worry, Buzz. We're gonna find her.

00:05:57.875 --> 00:05:58.875
I promise.

00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:02.417
[sighs]

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.624
Woody, I know it's just
a pretend ceremony,

00:06:06.625 --> 00:06:09.000
and Bonnie usually
decides these things, but...

00:06:10.208 --> 00:06:12.875
Well, if it were up to me,

00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:15.291
you'd be my best man.

00:06:15.292 --> 00:06:16.916
[gasps]

00:06:16.917 --> 00:06:18.292
Buzz, I...

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:20.249
I'd be honored.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.916
[sighs] But Jessie
will never speak to me again

00:06:22.917 --> 00:06:25.167
now that I've let Lily
take charge of the room.

00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:26.916
Wait a min-- Take charge.

00:06:26.917 --> 00:06:29.166
- I tried to.
- No, no, no. Buzz, that's it.

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:30.249
What is?

00:06:30.250 --> 00:06:32.250
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

